      "importance": 70,
      "importanceReasonZh": "该方案解决了多云环境下的数据出口费用问题，对AI开发者具有实际价值，且来自Hugging Face官方，可信度高。",
      "importanceReasonEn": "This solution addresses data egress fees in multi-cloud environments, offering practical value for AI developers, and is from Hugging Face official, high credibility.",
      "scoringMode": "ai",
      "titleZh": "在任何云上运行AI工作负载，在Hugging Face上存储：SkyPilot实现零出口存储",
      "titleEn": "Run AI workloads on any cloud, store on Hugging Face: zero-egress storage with SkyPilot",
      "summaryZh": "Hugging Face与SkyPilot合作，推出零出口存储方案，允许用户在任意云上运行AI工作负载，同时将数据存储在Hugging Face上，避免云厂商的出口费用。",
      "summaryEn": "Hugging Face collaborates with SkyPilot to offer zero-egress storage, enabling users to run AI workloads on any cloud while storing data on Hugging Face, avoiding cloud egress fees.",
      "keywords": [
        "SkyPilot",
        "Hugging Face",
        "zero-egress",
        "storage",
        "cloud"
      ],
      "topics": [
        "SkyPilot",
